# Synthetic P1 cell. Two orientations of one molecular cation share an
# ordered nitrogen and are stored in one molecule. Each orientation is a
# tetrahedron of carbon atoms at a carbon-nitrogen distance of 1.49 angstrom.
# Six ordered chlorine atoms sit on an octahedron 5 angstrom from the
# nitrogen, the same ligand positions as the ordered control. This is not a
# published structure.
